      "title": "Setup Notes",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## FLUX.2 [klein] 9B\n\nDistilled, Apache-2.0-licensed variant of Black Forest Labs' FLUX.2 model family. Requires a ComfyUI build with Flux.2 support (update ComfyUI first: https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui).\n\n**Model files** — download from the official Black Forest Labs page (https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein) or a Comfy-Org fp8/scaled repack if one is listed on https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org, and place them as:\n\n```\nComfyUI/\n├── models/\n│   ├── diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── flux2_klein_9b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n│   ├── text_encoders/\n│   │   └── flux2_text_encoder_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n│   └── vae/\n│       └── flux2_vae.safetensors\n```\n\nFile names above are placeholders for the loader widgets — replace them with whatever you actually download (exact published names vary by quantization/repack). Run this workflow once in ComfyUI to confirm it executes end-to-end with your installed nodes and downloaded models before selecting the matching `Flux2-Klein-9B.json` API workflow in RPGraph's ComfyUI provider settings.\n\n**Not verified against a live ComfyUI instance.** If a node (e.g. `ModelSamplingFlux`, `FluxGuidance`, `BasicGuider`) or the CLIPLoader `flux2` type is missing or named differently in your ComfyUI version, adjust this workflow, re-export it as an API workflow, and keep the RPGraph `{{prompt}}`, `{{width}}`, `{{height}}`, `{{diffusion_model}}`, `{{vae}}`, `{{text_encoder}}`, and `{{lora_0N}}` / `{{lora_strength_0N}}` placeholders intact."
      ],
